1
00:01:30,340 --> 00:01:33,578
=Against The Current=

2
00:01:33,579 --> 00:01:35,000
(Adapted from He Yanshan's novel,
Orchid Fragrance Fate)

3
00:01:35,180 --> 00:01:36,920
=Episode 15=
(This drama does not correspond)

4
00:01:36,930 --> 00:01:38,200
(to any real historical dynasty.)

5
00:01:38,210 --> 00:01:41,060
(The systems, culture, attire and other
dynastic elements have been adapted.)

6
00:01:45,239 --> 00:01:49,639
- Bravo!
- Bravo!

7
00:01:49,640 --> 00:01:54,759
- Bravo!
- Bravo!

8
00:01:56,239 --> 00:01:57,679
I came all this way to get you

9
00:01:57,920 --> 00:01:59,759
and missed the best part.

10
00:01:59,760 --> 00:02:02,800
Qin Qiong and Shan Xiongxin
each served their own cause.

11
00:02:02,856 --> 00:02:04,670
One fought
with all his might to defend Tang,

12
00:02:04,680 --> 00:02:06,904
while the other fought
with all his might against Tang.

13
00:02:07,159 --> 00:02:08,600
Both were heroes.

14
00:02:09,319 --> 00:02:10,559
This is the story of

15
00:02:10,560 --> 00:02:13,079
Qin Qiong building a shrine
in honor of Shan Xiongxin?

16
00:02:13,080 --> 00:02:14,680
Let's give her a little reward.

17
00:02:14,960 --> 00:02:16,799
That maid of yours is quite interesting.

18
00:02:16,872 --> 00:02:18,510
It was her first time
in a military camp,

19
00:02:18,520 --> 00:02:19,840
yet she wasn't frightened at all.

20
00:02:20,159 --> 00:02:22,359
Instead, she chatted away

21
00:02:22,360 --> 00:02:23,679
with the soldiers guarding her

22
00:02:23,680 --> 00:02:25,320
and told them stories.

23
00:02:25,479 --> 00:02:26,918
And of all things, she told stories

24
00:02:26,919 --> 00:02:29,359
about common-born heroes
fighting as soldiers,

25
00:02:29,360 --> 00:02:31,519
which was exactly
what the soldiers loved to hear.

26
00:02:31,960 --> 00:02:34,038
One after another,
they came to plead with me,

27
00:02:34,039 --> 00:02:36,199
insisting on hearing
the story to the end.

28
00:02:38,039 --> 00:02:39,239
It was wonderful.

29
00:02:39,439 --> 00:02:41,000
She is rather interesting.

30
00:02:41,240 --> 00:02:41,878
Everyone,

31
00:02:41,879 --> 00:02:43,158
shall we have another one?

32
00:02:43,159 --> 00:02:45,999
Another one!

33
00:02:46,000 --> 00:02:47,318
Want another one?

34
00:02:47,319 --> 00:02:51,400
- Another one!
- Another one!

35
00:02:53,080 --> 00:02:55,352
I heard the ointment
used in the army for chilblains

36
00:02:55,360 --> 00:02:56,878
works much better

37
00:02:56,879 --> 00:02:58,279
than what they sell at apothecaries.

38
00:02:58,280 --> 00:02:59,680
I'd like some.

39
00:03:00,680 --> 00:03:02,880
My mother has chilblains on her hands.

40
00:03:03,144 --> 00:03:05,230
Young Master
was born to wealth and privilege.

41
00:03:05,360 --> 00:03:07,440
You don't know that
for people at the bottom like us,

42
00:03:07,560 --> 00:03:09,400
sometimes simply staying alive

43
00:03:09,520 --> 00:03:11,320
takes everything we have.

44
00:03:11,719 --> 00:03:13,119
If we want to rise above our origins

45
00:03:13,120 --> 00:03:14,600
and live a better life,

46
00:03:14,840 --> 00:03:16,880
we may have to risk our lives.

47
00:03:17,560 --> 00:03:18,680
Aren't you

48
00:03:18,719 --> 00:03:19,919
afraid?

49
00:03:19,928 --> 00:03:21,310
I'm only going into the residence

50
00:03:21,319 --> 00:03:22,880
to see what's going on.

51
00:03:23,039 --> 00:03:24,519
What's there to be afraid of?

52
00:03:33,360 --> 00:03:34,638
Shall we have another one?

53
00:03:34,639 --> 00:03:38,919
- Another one!
- Another one!

54
00:03:42,280 --> 00:03:43,839
Why don't you give her to me?

55
00:03:43,840 --> 00:03:45,840
I'm willing to pay handsomely for her.

56
00:03:53,288 --> 00:03:55,550
It's a rare honor
to have caught Your Lordship's eye.

57
00:03:55,560 --> 00:03:57,800
I should rightfully offer her
to you without hesitation.

58
00:03:57,960 --> 00:03:59,158
But this maid

59
00:03:59,159 --> 00:04:00,840
was given to me by my mother,

60
00:04:01,159 --> 00:04:02,680
so I really can't part with her.

61
00:04:05,360 --> 00:04:07,359
No wonder she's your maid.

62
00:04:08,159 --> 00:04:11,400
When you want to be clear about things,
you call me Commander Yuan.

63
00:04:11,560 --> 00:04:15,039
When you want to play dumb,
you call me Your Lordship.

64
00:04:18,639 --> 00:04:19,559
Another one!

65
00:04:19,560 --> 00:04:20,800
- Bravo!
- Bravo!

66
00:04:22,800 --> 00:04:25,199
The Marquis is here!

67
00:04:26,079 --> 00:04:28,279
- Commander Yuan!
- Commander Yuan!

68
00:04:34,360 --> 00:04:37,288
- Your Lordship. Young Master.
- Your Lordship. Young Master.

69
00:04:39,120 --> 00:04:39,919
Your Young Master

70
00:04:39,920 --> 00:04:41,800
came especially to take you home.

71
00:04:41,839 --> 00:04:43,440
I won't see you off.

72
00:04:44,480 --> 00:04:45,919
The Wo pirates' confessions

73
00:04:45,920 --> 00:04:47,119
should be ready tomorrow.

74
00:04:47,120 --> 00:04:49,159
Come to the
Rear Military Command as well.

75
00:04:49,160 --> 00:04:51,398
You can see what they've confessed to.

76
00:04:51,399 --> 00:04:52,279
All right.

77
00:04:52,560 --> 00:04:53,680
See you tomorrow.

78
00:05:08,879 --> 00:05:10,199
Look at your eyes.

79
00:05:11,040 --> 00:05:12,880
You cried listening to the story?

80
00:05:41,480 --> 00:05:42,519
Young Master,

81
00:05:42,680 --> 00:05:44,480
did I do something wrong?

82
00:05:49,079 --> 00:05:49,920
No.

83
00:05:51,360 --> 00:05:52,359
I told you before,

84
00:05:52,360 --> 00:05:54,279
once it was done,
you'd be well rewarded.

85
00:05:54,519 --> 00:05:55,839
What do you want?

86
00:05:58,160 --> 00:06:00,438
I can't think of anything right now.

87
00:06:00,439 --> 00:06:02,359
Can I save up all my rewards

88
00:06:02,360 --> 00:06:04,120
and ask for them together
once I've decided?

89
00:06:07,160 --> 00:06:08,599
If you keep saving them up,

90
00:06:08,712 --> 00:06:10,648
what if I can't afford them
when the time comes?

91
00:06:11,160 --> 00:06:12,119
No.

92
00:06:12,120 --> 00:06:12,984
Whatever I want,

93
00:06:13,000 --> 00:06:15,120
you'll definitely be able
to give me, Young Master.

94
00:06:17,700 --> 00:06:23,540
♪I wonder if the past
has ever been heard♪

95
00:06:28,399 --> 00:06:30,199
Don't keep tugging at me.

96
00:06:30,759 --> 00:06:32,079
Why not?

97
00:06:32,160 --> 00:06:33,518
You used to hold my hand,

98
00:06:33,519 --> 00:06:34,800
and even hugged me.

99
00:06:35,240 --> 00:06:36,479
You were little then.

100
00:06:36,480 --> 00:06:38,000
How old are you now?

101
00:06:39,464 --> 00:06:41,176
I was only away at war for a few years,

102
00:06:41,224 --> 00:06:42,990
and now you're treating me
like a stranger.

103
00:06:43,000 --> 00:06:47,700
♪Love and guilt intertwine.
What if the image isn't real?♪

104
00:06:47,820 --> 00:06:53,140
♪I still remember your name♪

105
00:06:55,060 --> 00:07:02,460
♪I no longer blame the moon
for withholding its light♪

106
00:07:02,820 --> 00:07:10,460
♪I only pray that those
I've known still live and thrive♪

107
00:07:10,500 --> 00:07:14,899
♪No longer let the world's
wind and snow fall♪

108
00:07:14,900 --> 00:07:17,900
♪And leave the grass
and trees covered in frost♪

109
00:07:17,940 --> 00:07:21,979
♪I only wish that
where the lights grow dim♪

110
00:07:21,980 --> 00:07:28,380
♪You and I will walk there together♪

111
00:07:47,920 --> 00:07:49,040
Cuique.

112
00:07:57,720 --> 00:07:58,758
Jinqi.

113
00:07:58,759 --> 00:08:00,560
You're finally back.

114
00:08:01,160 --> 00:08:03,278
Congratulations, Jinqi,
on clearing your name

115
00:08:03,279 --> 00:08:04,680
and being reinstated.

116
00:08:05,959 --> 00:08:07,320
Please sit, both of you.

117
00:08:08,160 --> 00:08:09,279
Cuique,

118
00:08:10,720 --> 00:08:11,759
have a seat.

119
00:08:19,759 --> 00:08:21,359
After what happened to Jinqi,

120
00:08:21,360 --> 00:08:23,880
Zheng and Cuique were both very worried.

121
00:08:23,940 --> 00:08:25,912
They went to the temple
together to offer incense

122
00:08:25,944 --> 00:08:27,190
and pray for Jinqi's safety.

123
00:08:27,960 --> 00:08:29,896
Thank you for going
to all that trouble, Cuique.

124
00:08:31,279 --> 00:08:33,158
You have always
treated my brother and me

125
00:08:33,159 --> 00:08:34,359
like family.

126
00:08:34,632 --> 00:08:36,070
Unfortunately, we're of humble status

127
00:08:36,080 --> 00:08:37,400
and can do little to help.

128
00:08:37,480 --> 00:08:38,920
All I could do was go to the temple

129
00:08:38,980 --> 00:08:41,864
and kowtow a few more times to pray for
the Bodhisattva's protection.

130
00:08:42,639 --> 00:08:44,719
Now that Jinqi has returned safely,

131
00:08:44,720 --> 00:08:46,472
Cuique is going to the temple tomorrow

132
00:08:46,488 --> 00:08:48,070
to offer incense and fulfill her vow.

133
00:08:49,320 --> 00:08:51,079
I want to go, too.

134
00:08:53,879 --> 00:08:55,119
What did Aunt Lingxiao say?

135
00:08:56,120 --> 00:08:58,079
I pestered her
until she got tired of me.

136
00:08:58,080 --> 00:09:00,839
She said if you agree,

137
00:09:00,840 --> 00:09:02,079
then I can go.

138
00:09:03,679 --> 00:09:04,800
Jinqi,

139
00:09:04,960 --> 00:09:07,656
that temple is also known for
granting prayers for a good marriage.

140
00:09:08,120 --> 00:09:10,280
I'll pray for a good match for you.

141
00:09:20,679 --> 00:09:22,119
Take a few more servants with you.

142
00:09:22,440 --> 00:09:23,640
Go early and come back early.

143
00:09:25,799 --> 00:09:26,920
Got it.

144
00:09:27,120 --> 00:09:28,320
Cuique.

145
00:09:32,080 --> 00:09:33,280
We're leaving.

146
00:09:35,160 --> 00:09:37,480
- Second Young Lady, Young Lady Du,
- Second Young Lady, Young Lady Du,

147
00:09:37,490 --> 00:09:38,568
- take care.
- take care.

148
00:09:44,919 --> 00:09:46,040
Gantang.

149
00:09:46,360 --> 00:09:47,680
Go get Lanxiang.

150
00:09:47,879 --> 00:09:48,760
Yes.

151
00:09:49,679 --> 00:09:51,558
That wound of yours is still red.

152
00:09:51,559 --> 00:09:52,920
Will it leave a scar?

153
00:09:53,840 --> 00:09:55,199
I don't know either.

154
00:09:56,039 --> 00:09:57,160
Does it still hurt?

155
00:09:57,559 --> 00:09:58,680
No.

156
00:09:59,080 --> 00:10:00,079
Lanxiang.

157
00:10:01,879 --> 00:10:02,999
Gantang.

158
00:10:05,159 --> 00:10:06,558
Didn't you go to bathe?

159
00:10:06,559 --> 00:10:08,518
Why are you still in
those dirty clothes?

160
00:10:08,519 --> 00:10:09,479
Xiaolian came by.

161
00:10:09,480 --> 00:10:12,079
We got caught up talking,
so I was delayed for a while.

162
00:10:12,080 --> 00:10:13,638
Yuchan happened to need more water,

163
00:10:13,639 --> 00:10:15,319
so I gave her my hot water.

164
00:10:15,320 --> 00:10:17,280
I'll heat some more and bathe later.

165
00:10:17,320 --> 00:10:18,079
What's wrong?

166
00:10:18,080 --> 00:10:20,520
Young Master wants to see you.
You'd better hurry over.

167
00:10:21,320 --> 00:10:22,856
Then I'll leave you to your work.

168
00:10:22,904 --> 00:10:24,190
I should be going, too.

169
00:10:25,440 --> 00:10:26,359
Let's go.

170
00:10:45,039 --> 00:10:46,079
Young Master.

171
00:10:47,360 --> 00:10:48,798
When did Xiuwan

172
00:10:48,799 --> 00:10:50,520
become so close to Young Lady Du?

173
00:10:54,279 --> 00:10:55,640
I don't know.

174
00:10:57,679 --> 00:10:59,680
So there are things even you don't know.

175
00:11:03,159 --> 00:11:04,479
Keep an eye on them.

176
00:11:04,639 --> 00:11:06,638
See what Xiuwan and Young Lady Du

177
00:11:06,639 --> 00:11:08,119
usually do together.

178
00:11:08,840 --> 00:11:09,839
Yes.

179
00:11:14,840 --> 00:11:16,199
How is the wound

180
00:11:17,080 --> 00:11:18,199
on your neck?

181
00:11:19,919 --> 00:11:21,239
It's fine now.

182
00:11:22,000 --> 00:11:22,999
Doesn't it itch?

183
00:11:26,120 --> 00:11:27,560
It does itch a little.

184
00:11:30,360 --> 00:11:31,599
This is for the itching.

185
00:11:58,740 --> 00:12:01,940
♪Look at us♪

186
00:12:02,220 --> 00:12:06,700
♪We've shared
countless beautiful moments♪

187
00:12:08,568 --> 00:12:09,740
Thank you, Young Master.

188
00:12:09,759 --> 00:12:13,460
♪Through life's winding road,
we've weathered countless trials♪

189
00:12:14,980 --> 00:12:22,060
♪I'm blessed to spend each
peaceful day and night with you♪

190
00:12:23,140 --> 00:12:25,860
♪However deep the joy or sorrow♪

191
00:12:26,300 --> 00:12:29,459
♪There will always
be someone to share it with♪

192
00:12:29,460 --> 00:12:32,780
♪Our bond runs deep♪

193
00:12:32,860 --> 00:12:36,340
♪Binding us closely together♪

194
00:12:36,580 --> 00:12:39,499
♪After all
the questions life has brought♪

195
00:12:39,500 --> 00:12:44,220
♪This love has never
faded in the slightest♪

196
00:12:44,700 --> 00:12:48,780
♪A trace of fragrance lingers on♪

197
00:12:48,820 --> 00:12:52,660
♪How fortunate
to find one person in a lifetime♪

198
00:12:52,700 --> 00:12:54,820
♪Through the gentle passing years♪

199
00:12:54,860 --> 00:13:01,020
♪My heart remains
as true to you as ever♪

200
00:13:18,039 --> 00:13:22,520
The total is 123 taels and eight coins.

201
00:13:23,639 --> 00:13:26,199
Next is four reams of xuan paper.

202
00:13:26,399 --> 00:13:28,359
Just write it right next to this.

203
00:13:28,360 --> 00:13:29,359
All right.

204
00:13:47,900 --> 00:13:52,860
(Yuchan. Lanxiang)

205
00:13:56,960 --> 00:13:57,638
Lanxiang.

206
00:13:57,639 --> 00:13:59,038
Go find me a back scratcher.

207
00:13:59,039 --> 00:14:00,520
My back is terribly itchy.

208
00:14:10,679 --> 00:14:12,199
You've broken out in a rash.

209
00:14:13,000 --> 00:14:13,999
Really?

210
00:14:14,072 --> 00:14:14,710
It's so itchy.

211
00:14:14,720 --> 00:14:16,280
Take a look at my back for me.

212
00:14:24,360 --> 00:14:25,592
It looks quite serious.

213
00:14:25,720 --> 00:14:28,040
You should go to the medical hall
and see a physician.

214
00:14:30,120 --> 00:14:33,040
It's nothing serious.
No need to see a physician.

215
00:14:33,559 --> 00:14:35,239
I probably caught a chill yesterday

216
00:14:35,240 --> 00:14:36,599
and broke out in hives.

217
00:14:36,720 --> 00:14:38,758
Later, go to Luxue Lodge for me

218
00:14:38,759 --> 00:14:41,040
and ask Young Lady Du
for some anti-itch ointment.

219
00:14:41,879 --> 00:14:42,439
All right.

220
00:14:42,440 --> 00:14:43,719
I'll go now.

221
00:14:49,300 --> 00:14:52,319
(Lin Residence, Luxue Lodge)

222
00:14:52,320 --> 00:14:53,839
We do have anti-itch ointment,

223
00:14:53,840 --> 00:14:56,479
but Lingdang usually keeps it.

224
00:14:56,960 --> 00:14:58,359
Early this morning, Young Lady Du

225
00:14:58,360 --> 00:14:59,839
took Lingdang and Second Young Lady

226
00:14:59,840 --> 00:15:01,678
to the temple to fulfill their vows.

227
00:15:01,679 --> 00:15:04,320
They probably won't be back
until this afternoon.

228
00:15:04,720 --> 00:15:06,119
When Young Lady Du returns,

229
00:15:06,120 --> 00:15:07,479
I'll ask her for the ointment

230
00:15:07,480 --> 00:15:08,839
and bring it over to you.

231
00:15:08,960 --> 00:15:09,959
All right.

232
00:15:09,960 --> 00:15:11,918
Yuchan's hives are quite severe.

233
00:15:11,919 --> 00:15:13,678
As soon as Young Lady Du returns,

234
00:15:13,679 --> 00:15:15,119
remember to bring the medicine over.

235
00:15:15,120 --> 00:15:16,239
I will.

236
00:15:37,960 --> 00:15:39,439
Young Lady Du

237
00:15:39,440 --> 00:15:41,040
brought this chess set from home?

238
00:15:41,360 --> 00:15:43,158
She only got it recently.

239
00:15:43,159 --> 00:15:44,798
Young Lady Du said her brother

240
00:15:44,799 --> 00:15:46,359
knew she enjoyed playing chess,

241
00:15:46,360 --> 00:15:48,440
so he bought her a new set as a gift.

242
00:15:59,879 --> 00:16:02,239
You just said Second Young Lady
and Young Lady Du

243
00:16:02,240 --> 00:16:03,719
went to the temple together.

244
00:16:03,720 --> 00:16:04,439
When did they

245
00:16:04,440 --> 00:16:06,119
become so close?

246
00:16:09,279 --> 00:16:13,199
I think it was around
the time Young Master was arrested.

247
00:16:16,120 --> 00:16:18,158
Young Lady Du is probably
gentle and considerate,

248
00:16:18,159 --> 00:16:20,558
so Second Young Lady
often came to talk to her,

249
00:16:20,559 --> 00:16:22,440
and the two of them
gradually became close.

250
00:16:25,240 --> 00:16:26,678
Don't tell Young Lady Du

251
00:16:26,679 --> 00:16:28,158
what I just said to you.

252
00:16:28,159 --> 00:16:29,439
If she asks,

253
00:16:29,440 --> 00:16:31,239
just say I came
for some anti-itch ointment,

254
00:16:31,240 --> 00:16:32,038
but she wasn't here,

255
00:16:32,039 --> 00:16:33,440
so I left.

256
00:16:34,399 --> 00:16:35,520
All right.

257
00:16:35,759 --> 00:16:36,760
I'm leaving.

258
00:16:55,320 --> 00:16:57,839
(A set of Yunzi stones
is worth a fortune.)

259
00:16:59,360 --> 00:17:01,119
(Where did Du Zheng get the money)

260
00:17:01,120 --> 00:17:03,599
(to buy Du Cuique
such expensive Yunzi stones?)

261
00:17:23,839 --> 00:17:24,879
Make way.

262
00:17:25,160 --> 00:17:26,280
Let His Lordship pass first.

263
00:17:57,640 --> 00:17:58,518
Grandpa,

264
00:17:58,519 --> 00:18:00,239
I'll help you push.

265
00:18:00,240 --> 00:18:01,800
Sir, we'll help you.

266
00:18:04,839 --> 00:18:05,879
Thank you.

267
00:18:10,200 --> 00:18:11,359
Thank you, My Lords.

268
00:18:11,440 --> 00:18:12,200
It's nothing.

269
00:18:42,759 --> 00:18:44,318
Lately, I've been troubled

270
00:18:44,319 --> 00:18:45,439
by a personal matter.

271
00:18:45,768 --> 00:18:47,096
It suddenly occurred to me

272
00:18:47,128 --> 00:18:48,870
that perhaps
I could discuss it with you.

273
00:18:49,359 --> 00:18:51,879
Your Lordship has given me
valuable guidance.

274
00:18:52,359 --> 00:18:53,919
If I can help ease your worries,

275
00:18:54,079 --> 00:18:55,280
I'll do everything I can.

276
00:18:56,559 --> 00:18:58,480
In private, just call me Yuan.

277
00:18:59,599 --> 00:19:00,560
Yuan.

278
00:19:03,176 --> 00:19:04,200
It's been eight years

279
00:19:04,248 --> 00:19:06,280
since Commandery
Princess Chenyang passed away.

280
00:19:06,519 --> 00:19:08,520
My mother has been urging me to remarry,

281
00:19:09,359 --> 00:19:11,720
but I've had my concerns
and put it off until now.

282
00:19:12,480 --> 00:19:13,879
A marriage joins two families.

283
00:19:14,039 --> 00:19:17,000
I don't expect a deeply loving
and devoted marriage,

284
00:19:17,440 --> 00:19:19,358
but at the very least,
we must be compatible

285
00:19:19,359 --> 00:19:20,800
and not grow to resent each other.

286
00:19:22,079 --> 00:19:23,358
I have only one daughter.

287
00:19:23,359 --> 00:19:24,639
She's already eleven.

288
00:19:24,839 --> 00:19:26,839
In a few years, she'll come of age,

289
00:19:27,559 --> 00:19:29,599
and my mother is getting older.

290
00:19:29,759 --> 00:19:31,439
No matter how much I love my daughter,

291
00:19:31,960 --> 00:19:33,760
a father can't take a mother's place.

292
00:19:36,720 --> 00:19:38,280
What you mean is...

293
00:19:48,008 --> 00:19:50,760
The position of madam of
the Marquis's Residence is still vacant.

294
00:19:52,440 --> 00:19:54,359
I intend to remarry.

295
00:20:02,559 --> 00:20:04,119
From what I've seen of you, Fengtai,

296
00:20:04,152 --> 00:20:06,390
and how the maids
of Lin Residence conduct themselves,

297
00:20:06,759 --> 00:20:09,320
it's clear that the Lin family
is kind and well-disciplined.

298
00:20:10,559 --> 00:20:12,480
I hear your younger sister
is still unmarried.

299
00:20:13,119 --> 00:20:14,240
I wonder if I...

300
00:20:17,319 --> 00:20:18,439
I wonder...

301
00:20:18,559 --> 00:20:19,159
if...

302
00:20:19,160 --> 00:20:20,439
perhaps...

303
00:20:25,720 --> 00:20:26,758
Yuan.

304
00:20:26,759 --> 00:20:28,000
My second aunt

305
00:20:28,160 --> 00:20:30,480
has recently been worrying
about Xiuwan's marriage.

306
00:20:31,319 --> 00:20:32,839
If you're interested,

307
00:20:33,079 --> 00:20:34,439
I'd be willing to help

308
00:20:34,440 --> 00:20:36,359
and sound out my second aunt.

309
00:20:37,944 --> 00:20:39,560
Then I'll have to trouble you, Fengtai,

310
00:20:39,680 --> 00:20:41,280
to put in a good word for me.

311
00:20:41,720 --> 00:20:42,399
Of course.

312
00:20:48,744 --> 00:20:50,136
Your Lordship, Young Master.

313
00:20:50,264 --> 00:20:53,336
Something happened at the Prison Office
of the Rear Military Command.

314
00:21:16,340 --> 00:21:19,130
(Zheng Baichuan, Duke Xianguo,
Jinling Joint Defense Commander)

315
00:21:19,144 --> 00:21:20,820
(Commander of the Rear Military Command)

316
00:21:23,800 --> 00:21:25,816
Commander Zheng.

317
00:21:33,799 --> 00:21:35,038
Commander,

318
00:21:35,039 --> 00:21:36,558
from our preliminary examination,

319
00:21:36,559 --> 00:21:39,079
all twelve died from poisoning.

320
00:21:39,200 --> 00:21:40,999
The poison was probably put

321
00:21:41,000 --> 00:21:42,679
in their breakfast this morning.

322
00:21:59,768 --> 00:22:02,599
The porridge for all the prisoners
was cooked together,

323
00:22:03,080 --> 00:22:04,990
yet only the Wo pirates
in these two cells

324
00:22:05,000 --> 00:22:06,239
were poisoned.

325
00:22:06,240 --> 00:22:09,239
That means the cook didn't poison them.

326
00:22:09,240 --> 00:22:11,688
The jailer who served
the porridge must be responsible.

327
00:22:12,680 --> 00:22:14,000
Where is that jailer?

328
00:22:16,400 --> 00:22:17,399
Commander,

329
00:22:17,400 --> 00:22:19,758
the jailer who served breakfast
to the prisoners today

330
00:22:19,759 --> 00:22:20,798
was Wang Er.

331
00:22:20,799 --> 00:22:22,159
He must have poisoned them.

332
00:22:22,160 --> 00:22:22,719
I...

333
00:22:22,720 --> 00:22:24,520
I don't know anything!

334
00:22:28,079 --> 00:22:28,879
Wang Er!

335
00:22:28,880 --> 00:22:29,838
It wasn't me! It wasn't!

336
00:22:29,839 --> 00:22:31,879
It wasn't me!

337
00:22:38,799 --> 00:22:40,119
He hasn't been dead long.

338
00:22:40,168 --> 00:22:41,910
He must have
taken poison to kill himself.

339
00:22:46,440 --> 00:22:48,119
Assistant Commander Lin is right.

340
00:22:48,200 --> 00:22:50,439
There are still traces
of the poison on his fingers.

341
00:22:54,440 --> 00:22:55,599
Fine.

342
00:22:57,519 --> 00:22:58,399
Fine.

343
00:23:01,000 --> 00:23:03,320
He may be dead,
but he can't hide the truth.

344
00:23:03,720 --> 00:23:04,919
I refuse to believe

345
00:23:05,200 --> 00:23:06,758
that after poisoning so many people,

346
00:23:06,759 --> 00:23:08,639
he left no clues behind.

347
00:23:10,000 --> 00:23:11,480
Investigate Wang Er's family.

348
00:23:11,759 --> 00:23:14,240
Find out who he usually associated with.

349
00:23:14,799 --> 00:23:15,599
- Yes.
- Yes.

350
00:23:26,480 --> 00:23:26,838
Quick.

351
00:23:26,839 --> 00:23:27,800
Get to work.

352
00:23:32,759 --> 00:23:35,200
We only interrogated
six Wo pirates yesterday.

353
00:23:35,384 --> 00:23:37,910
We hadn't even finished
the preliminary questioning.

354
00:23:39,224 --> 00:23:40,960
Someone in
the imperial court is involved.

355
00:23:43,319 --> 00:23:44,280
I know.

356
00:23:44,984 --> 00:23:46,950
Otherwise, you wouldn't
have sent two maids

357
00:23:46,960 --> 00:23:48,320
to deliver a message to me.

358
00:23:49,279 --> 00:23:51,758
I just didn't expect their reach

359
00:23:51,759 --> 00:23:53,800
to extend this far.

360
00:23:54,760 --> 00:23:57,430
Even the cells at the Prison Office
of the Rear Military Command

361
00:23:57,440 --> 00:23:58,919
couldn't keep them out.

362
00:24:01,560 --> 00:24:02,910
Are you afraid, Your Lordship?

363
00:24:05,799 --> 00:24:06,960
Trying to provoke me?

364
00:24:08,920 --> 00:24:11,159
I am Marquis Yongchang.
What have I to fear?

365
00:24:13,079 --> 00:24:14,200
But you,

366
00:24:15,000 --> 00:24:16,399
a mere Assistant Commander,

367
00:24:16,400 --> 00:24:18,079
have only just been reinstated.

368
00:24:18,160 --> 00:24:19,760
You'd better think this through.

369
00:24:23,519 --> 00:24:25,359
You're a hereditary marquis.

370
00:24:25,880 --> 00:24:28,760
I earned my rank as Assistant Commander
on the battlefield.

371
00:24:34,408 --> 00:24:36,150
We'll investigate this to the end.

372
00:24:36,559 --> 00:24:37,599
To the very end.

373
00:24:47,960 --> 00:24:49,119
You have a slight fever.

374
00:24:49,599 --> 00:24:51,240
Do you feel unwell anywhere else?

375
00:24:52,160 --> 00:24:54,119
After applying Young Lady Du's ointment,

376
00:24:54,160 --> 00:24:55,879
it doesn't itch anymore.

377
00:24:56,920 --> 00:24:58,040
It's just that

378
00:24:59,039 --> 00:25:00,320
my head hurts,

379
00:25:00,799 --> 00:25:02,119
and I feel weak.

380
00:25:02,559 --> 00:25:03,599
Here's the water.

381
00:25:20,200 --> 00:25:22,000
It doesn't look like hives.

382
00:25:22,240 --> 00:25:23,399
I'll go to First Madam

383
00:25:23,400 --> 00:25:25,838
and ask her to send
someone for a physician.

384
00:25:25,839 --> 00:25:26,839
No.

385
00:25:27,119 --> 00:25:28,240
You can't.

386
00:25:28,559 --> 00:25:29,320
I...

387
00:25:31,480 --> 00:25:32,800
We can't let First Madam know.

388
00:25:33,352 --> 00:25:34,744
If First Madam finds out,

389
00:25:34,792 --> 00:25:37,430
she'll be afraid Yuchan might pass
the illness to Young Master.

390
00:25:38,400 --> 00:25:41,280
She'll have Yuchan moved out
of the residence immediately.

391
00:25:43,144 --> 00:25:45,288
Then the food, clothing,
and other necessities

392
00:25:45,290 --> 00:25:46,760
won't be as good as they are here.

393
00:25:48,720 --> 00:25:50,599
Even getting
hot water would be difficult.

394
00:25:52,319 --> 00:25:55,000
A minor illness could become serious.

395
00:25:56,079 --> 00:25:58,919
My mother said many maids who fall ill

396
00:25:59,240 --> 00:26:01,040
are sent away
like that and never return.

397
00:26:11,839 --> 00:26:13,560
I'll go to Madam Han

398
00:26:14,400 --> 00:26:15,919
and find an excuse

399
00:26:16,000 --> 00:26:17,688
to leave the residence
and buy something.

400
00:26:17,920 --> 00:26:20,278
Once I get to the apothecary,
I'll describe the symptoms

401
00:26:20,280 --> 00:26:22,440
and quietly bring some medicine back.

402
00:26:22,450 --> 00:26:24,070
A proper diagnosis requires
observation, listening,

403
00:26:24,080 --> 00:26:25,240
questioning, and pulse-taking.

404
00:26:25,256 --> 00:26:26,792
We don't know anything about medicine.

405
00:26:26,824 --> 00:26:29,000
If we just describe the symptoms
and get some medicine,

406
00:26:29,048 --> 00:26:30,960
the wrong medicine
could delay treatment.

407
00:26:34,279 --> 00:26:37,118
Doesn't Young Lady Du know medicine?

408
00:26:37,119 --> 00:26:38,599
Why don't we ask Young Lady Du?

409
00:26:44,400 --> 00:26:46,399
Young Lady Du is
First Madam's honored guest.

410
00:26:46,400 --> 00:26:48,040
Wouldn't that be inappropriate?

411
00:26:51,359 --> 00:26:53,079
Lanxiang is right.

412
00:26:53,640 --> 00:26:55,320
We're only maids.

413
00:26:55,464 --> 00:26:58,550
We only dared to ask for some ointment
because we could rely on Young Master

414
00:26:58,559 --> 00:27:00,359
and First Madam's standing.

415
00:27:01,319 --> 00:27:03,679
If we treat Young Lady Du
like a physician,

416
00:27:03,799 --> 00:27:05,560
First Madam
will certainly be displeased.

417
00:27:06,240 --> 00:27:07,520
Then what should we do?

418
00:27:09,440 --> 00:27:10,679
I'll go find Jiugao.

419
00:27:10,839 --> 00:27:12,038
I'll ask Jiugao to find a way

420
00:27:12,039 --> 00:27:13,479
to bring in a physician

421
00:27:13,480 --> 00:27:15,040
he knows discreetly.

422
00:27:19,112 --> 00:27:21,670
The sooner you take the medicine,
the sooner you'll recover.

423
00:27:22,000 --> 00:27:24,679
It'll be more troublesome
if we wait until you get worse.

424
00:27:29,519 --> 00:27:30,359
Go.

425
00:27:32,119 --> 00:27:33,599
Take good care of Yuchan.

426
00:28:08,240 --> 00:28:09,320
Young Master.

427
00:28:11,240 --> 00:28:12,399
Where are you going?

428
00:28:14,440 --> 00:28:16,110
(About what happened at Zhichun Hall,)

429
00:28:16,119 --> 00:28:17,719
(if I'm to keep it from First Madam,)

430
00:28:17,720 --> 00:28:19,240
(I'll have to let Young Master know.)

431
00:28:20,799 --> 00:28:23,919
I was just about to find
a servant to get Jiugao.

432
00:28:24,319 --> 00:28:25,960
Yuchan has a slight fever.

433
00:28:26,119 --> 00:28:28,318
I want Jiugao to bring in a physician

434
00:28:28,319 --> 00:28:29,800
to examine Yuchan.

435
00:28:35,640 --> 00:28:38,040
(Scheming from head to toe...)

436
00:28:42,200 --> 00:28:43,320
Young Master.

437
00:28:44,799 --> 00:28:47,439
Take my card
and find Physician Li, who regularly

438
00:28:47,440 --> 00:28:49,119
checks Old Madam's pulse.

439
00:28:49,640 --> 00:28:51,038
First, have Physician Li

440
00:28:51,039 --> 00:28:52,999
check Old Madam's pulse,

441
00:28:53,000 --> 00:28:54,000
and then bring him

442
00:28:54,599 --> 00:28:56,040
to Zhichun Hall for a visit.

443
00:28:57,200 --> 00:28:58,359
Thank you, Young Master.

444
00:29:00,559 --> 00:29:02,879
I'll tell Madam Han

445
00:29:02,880 --> 00:29:04,280
to keep this quiet for now.

446
00:29:04,599 --> 00:29:07,439
You must all keep quiet about it, too.

447
00:29:09,200 --> 00:29:10,000
Yes.

448
00:29:10,400 --> 00:29:12,278
Young Master,
before the night curfew begins,

449
00:29:12,280 --> 00:29:13,224
I'll hurry over there

450
00:29:13,230 --> 00:29:15,159
and ask Physician Li to come
tomorrow morning.

451
00:29:15,319 --> 00:29:16,200
Go.

452
00:29:34,240 --> 00:29:35,520
I'll change my clothes.

453
00:29:35,960 --> 00:29:37,439
Come with me to Rongzhang House.

454
00:29:41,880 --> 00:29:44,200
I was worried Xiuwan
might take it badly before,

455
00:29:44,720 --> 00:29:47,399
but now she's acting
as if nothing happened.

456
00:29:47,480 --> 00:29:49,960
She spends every day
happily with Young Lady Du.

457
00:29:52,119 --> 00:29:53,399
Instead, I'm the one

458
00:29:53,839 --> 00:29:55,960
who can't eat or sleep all day.

459
00:29:58,552 --> 00:30:01,030
There were families who would
have made suitable matches,

460
00:30:01,039 --> 00:30:03,599
but I turned them all down
because of the Xie family.

461
00:30:04,440 --> 00:30:06,800
Now, after all that,

462
00:30:06,960 --> 00:30:09,599
how could I possibly go back to them?

463
00:30:11,119 --> 00:30:13,359
Don't worry too much.

464
00:30:13,720 --> 00:30:16,320
I think Xiuwan is blessed
with good fortune.

465
00:30:16,440 --> 00:30:18,118
She might just find

466
00:30:18,119 --> 00:30:20,079
an even better match
than the Xie family.

467
00:30:20,319 --> 00:30:22,118
We've considered every suitable family

468
00:30:22,119 --> 00:30:23,038
in all of Jinling City.

469
00:30:23,039 --> 00:30:25,280
Where could we find anyone
better than the Xie family?

470
00:30:26,240 --> 00:30:27,639
Young Master is here.

471
00:30:27,920 --> 00:30:29,040
Young Master.

472
00:30:32,400 --> 00:30:33,399
Wait here for me.

473
00:30:33,799 --> 00:30:34,560
Yes.

474
00:30:41,759 --> 00:30:43,999
Mother. Aunt Lingxiao.

475
00:30:44,000 --> 00:30:45,838
What brings you here at this hour?

476
00:30:45,839 --> 00:30:47,240
Is something the matter?

477
00:30:48,319 --> 00:30:49,719
I need to speak with Aunt Lingxiao.

478
00:30:49,720 --> 00:30:51,199
I heard she was here with you,

479
00:30:51,200 --> 00:30:52,280
so I came over.

480
00:30:56,799 --> 00:30:57,919
Speak with me?

481
00:31:01,240 --> 00:31:02,439
What is it?

482
00:31:03,119 --> 00:31:04,838
Because of the padded coats,

483
00:31:04,839 --> 00:31:07,040
Marquis Yongchang and I became friends.

484
00:31:07,319 --> 00:31:09,040
He thinks highly of the Lin family

485
00:31:09,319 --> 00:31:10,439
and wants...

486
00:31:12,039 --> 00:31:13,679
He wants to marry Xiuwan.

487
00:31:16,839 --> 00:31:19,639
Mar... Mar...

488
00:31:20,720 --> 00:31:22,480
Mar...

489
00:31:23,279 --> 00:31:26,399
You mean Marquis Yongchang,
Yuan Shaohui?

490
00:31:27,319 --> 00:31:28,560
Exactly.

491
00:31:30,920 --> 00:31:33,479
What sort of man is the Marquis?

492
00:31:33,480 --> 00:31:34,359
Right.

493
00:31:34,720 --> 00:31:36,598
Although we haven't
known each other long,

494
00:31:36,599 --> 00:31:38,359
we hit it off
as if we'd been old friends.

495
00:31:38,400 --> 00:31:40,570
Yuan is accomplished
in both civil and military affairs

496
00:31:40,584 --> 00:31:41,710
and has a steady temperament.

497
00:31:41,720 --> 00:31:43,038
He would make a good husband.

498
00:31:43,039 --> 00:31:44,159
Good.

499
00:31:44,519 --> 00:31:45,199
Sit.

500
00:31:45,200 --> 00:31:46,119
Sit.

501
00:31:47,279 --> 00:31:49,639
Of course I know Marquis Yongchang
would be a fine match.

502
00:31:49,920 --> 00:31:50,960
But now,

503
00:31:51,000 --> 00:31:53,480
your second uncle
doesn't even hold an official post.

504
00:31:54,039 --> 00:31:55,119
I'm afraid...

505
00:31:56,200 --> 00:31:58,280
I'm afraid the match
may be beyond our reach.

506
00:31:58,480 --> 00:31:59,879
Don't worry, Aunt Lingxiao.

507
00:32:00,200 --> 00:32:02,239
Yuan isn't someone
who cares about such things.

508
00:32:02,240 --> 00:32:04,040
Since he brought it up himself,

509
00:32:04,119 --> 00:32:05,639
he must sincerely wish to marry Xiuwan.

510
00:32:05,720 --> 00:32:07,079
Wonderful.

511
00:32:07,920 --> 00:32:09,479
Didn't Shunhua just say

512
00:32:09,480 --> 00:32:11,000
that perhaps Xiuwan could find

513
00:32:11,080 --> 00:32:13,030
an even better match
than the Xie family?

514
00:32:13,039 --> 00:32:13,838
See?

515
00:32:13,839 --> 00:32:15,318
And now she really has.

516
00:32:15,319 --> 00:32:16,520
She has.

517
00:32:16,559 --> 00:32:20,000
How old is Marquis Yongchang?

518
00:32:20,720 --> 00:32:24,320
Could he be a little too old?

519
00:32:24,920 --> 00:32:26,200
Thirty-two.

520
00:32:26,759 --> 00:32:27,959
Thirty-two?

521
00:32:27,960 --> 00:32:29,959
Not old at all.

522
00:32:29,960 --> 00:32:32,599
An older man knows better
how to cherish his wife.

523
00:32:35,519 --> 00:32:37,118
Did the late Commandery Princess

524
00:32:37,119 --> 00:32:38,960
leave behind a child?

525
00:32:40,359 --> 00:32:41,479
She has a daughter

526
00:32:41,480 --> 00:32:43,079
who's already eleven.

527
00:32:45,559 --> 00:32:47,040
A daughter.

528
00:32:48,160 --> 00:32:49,919
A daughter isn't a problem.

529
00:32:50,359 --> 00:32:52,558
In a few years, once she's betrothed,

530
00:32:52,560 --> 00:32:54,072
she'll marry and leave the household.

531
00:32:54,319 --> 00:32:56,078
If she gets along well with Xiuwan,

532
00:32:56,080 --> 00:32:57,512
they can spend more time together.

533
00:32:57,544 --> 00:32:59,470
If not, they can keep their distance.

534
00:32:59,480 --> 00:33:01,240
Either way, it won't be a problem.

535
00:33:01,319 --> 00:33:03,320
It won't.

536
00:33:04,072 --> 00:33:05,950
If you have no objections,
Aunt Lingxiao,

537
00:33:05,960 --> 00:33:08,119
- I'll give Yuan an answer tomorrow.
- Xiuwan.

538
00:33:08,248 --> 00:33:08,790
Don't pull me.

539
00:33:08,799 --> 00:33:11,320
Have him send a matchmaker
to formally discuss the marriage.

540
00:33:11,920 --> 00:33:13,200
Good.

541
00:33:13,279 --> 00:33:14,560
Good.

542
00:33:18,960 --> 00:33:20,240
Mother. Aunt Lingxiao.

543
00:33:20,279 --> 00:33:21,879
I'll take my leave now.

544
00:33:26,440 --> 00:33:27,280
Let's go.

545
00:33:34,599 --> 00:33:36,679
This is wonderful!

546
00:33:36,759 --> 00:33:39,118
Everyone in Jinling City knows

547
00:33:39,119 --> 00:33:41,159
Marquis Yongchang is a capable man.

548
00:33:41,176 --> 00:33:43,270
More importantly,
all these years his inner household

549
00:33:43,279 --> 00:33:45,040
has remained free of concubines.

550
00:33:45,559 --> 00:33:48,118
Back when the Commandery Princess
first passed away,

551
00:33:48,119 --> 00:33:50,480
so many families wanted
to arrange a marriage with him.

552
00:33:50,720 --> 00:33:51,558
And now,

553
00:33:51,559 --> 00:33:52,558
such a wonderful match

554
00:33:52,559 --> 00:33:55,040
has actually come to our Xiuwan.

555
00:33:55,759 --> 00:33:57,358
If she marries him,

556
00:33:57,359 --> 00:33:59,560
she'll be the Marchioness.

557
00:33:59,759 --> 00:34:02,798
Then I'll have to show off

558
00:34:02,799 --> 00:34:04,480
in front of the Xie family.

559
00:34:04,759 --> 00:34:06,038
Show off?

560
00:34:06,039 --> 00:34:07,200
This is wonderful!

561
00:34:07,519 --> 00:34:08,640
Xiuwan.

562
00:34:08,760 --> 00:34:09,999
Xiuwan!

563
00:34:11,400 --> 00:34:12,439
Xiuwan.

564
00:34:26,920 --> 00:34:29,399
This isn't something

565
00:34:29,400 --> 00:34:30,640
we can solve by making a scene.

566
00:34:33,199 --> 00:34:34,320
Let's go.

567
00:34:58,199 --> 00:34:58,959
I will never

568
00:34:58,960 --> 00:35:00,600
marry an old man.

569
00:35:00,840 --> 00:35:02,319
I'm a person,

570
00:35:02,320 --> 00:35:04,280
not something for my family to show off.

571
00:35:05,159 --> 00:35:07,200
Marquis's wife, Madam Ma, huh?

572
00:35:07,240 --> 00:35:09,128
Whoever wants
those titles can have them.

573
00:35:21,599 --> 00:35:23,158
Anyone Jinqi approves of

574
00:35:23,159 --> 00:35:24,559
can't be that bad.

575
00:35:26,360 --> 00:35:27,600
What do you know?

576
00:35:31,440 --> 00:35:32,559
You two,

577
00:35:33,800 --> 00:35:35,839
don't go around telling anyone.

578
00:35:40,040 --> 00:35:41,430
We may be foolish, but even we know

579
00:35:41,440 --> 00:35:43,200
something like this
can't be talked about.

580
00:35:44,039 --> 00:35:44,959
All right.

581
00:35:45,159 --> 00:35:46,479
It's almost dark.

582
00:35:46,520 --> 00:35:48,350
You should hurry back
to your own courtyards.

583
00:35:49,199 --> 00:35:50,479
Cuique.

584
00:36:02,760 --> 00:36:04,959
Xiuwan isn't close to us anymore.

585
00:36:05,920 --> 00:36:07,439
She only spends time with Cuique.

586
00:36:08,880 --> 00:36:10,919
She's been like this all this time.

587
00:36:16,920 --> 00:36:17,799
Xiuru.

588
00:36:17,800 --> 00:36:20,039
I know you're worried
about your marriage, too.

589
00:36:20,119 --> 00:36:21,038
Don't worry.

590
00:36:21,039 --> 00:36:22,319
I'll ask Mother

591
00:36:22,320 --> 00:36:24,240
to find you a good match.

592
00:36:25,400 --> 00:36:26,760
Someone like me,

593
00:36:26,808 --> 00:36:29,352
with nothing outstanding in virtue,
looks, speech, or needlework,

594
00:36:29,559 --> 00:36:31,640
could hardly hope for a good match.

595
00:36:31,704 --> 00:36:33,750
Don't make things difficult
for her on my account.

596
00:36:33,760 --> 00:36:35,479
You are wonderful.

597
00:36:35,480 --> 00:36:37,559
I'm sure you'll find
a wonderful husband.

598
00:36:52,400 --> 00:36:54,280
I just have a few red rashes.

599
00:36:54,340 --> 00:36:56,300
(Lin Residence, Qingsu House)
They're a little itchy.

600
00:36:56,312 --> 00:36:57,430
Why can't I get out of bed?

601
00:36:58,719 --> 00:37:01,039
You have a rash, so you shouldn't
be exposed to the wind.

602
00:37:01,360 --> 00:37:03,158
Stay inside for a few days.

603
00:37:03,159 --> 00:37:04,720
You can go out once you're better.

604
00:37:06,960 --> 00:37:07,999
First Madam.

605
00:37:08,320 --> 00:37:09,800
Physician Li is here.

606
00:37:13,000 --> 00:37:14,760
Xiushu hasn't come of age yet,

607
00:37:14,800 --> 00:37:16,970
and Physician Li
has watched her grow up.

608
00:37:17,000 --> 00:37:17,790
It's fine.

609
00:37:17,800 --> 00:37:19,238
Show him in.

610
00:37:19,239 --> 00:37:20,200
Yes.

611
00:37:21,960 --> 00:37:22,718
Physician Li,

612
00:37:22,719 --> 00:37:23,800
this way, please.

613
00:37:25,920 --> 00:37:27,120
Physician Li.

614
00:37:27,360 --> 00:37:29,600
Greetings, First Madam Lin.

615
00:37:29,719 --> 00:37:30,839
Please sit.

616
00:37:30,920 --> 00:37:32,200
Grandpa Li.

617
00:37:33,960 --> 00:37:35,078
Let me take a look.

618
00:37:35,079 --> 00:37:36,640
Where do you feel unwell?

619
00:37:41,000 --> 00:37:42,359
When she woke up this morning,

620
00:37:42,360 --> 00:37:43,158
her maid

621
00:37:43,159 --> 00:37:44,759
noticed that Xiushu

622
00:37:44,760 --> 00:37:46,080
had developed a red rash.

623
00:37:46,232 --> 00:37:48,070
We know she can't
be around peach blossoms,

624
00:37:48,070 --> 00:37:50,264
so there isn't
a single peach tree in the residence.

625
00:37:50,312 --> 00:37:52,240
I also asked about her diet just now.

626
00:37:52,360 --> 00:37:53,999
She's eaten the same as usual.

627
00:37:55,192 --> 00:37:56,150
Other than the itching,

628
00:37:56,159 --> 00:37:57,919
do you feel unwell anywhere else?

629
00:37:59,480 --> 00:38:00,800
No.

630
00:38:00,880 --> 00:38:02,280
It's just a little itchy.

631
00:38:05,000 --> 00:38:06,640
As spring turns to summer,

632
00:38:06,679 --> 00:38:07,959
the weather is unpredictable.

633
00:38:08,344 --> 00:38:10,870
The elderly and children
sometimes have trouble adjusting.

634
00:38:11,630 --> 00:38:13,976
You must have come
into contact with pollen

635
00:38:14,008 --> 00:38:15,430
while playing in the garden

636
00:38:15,440 --> 00:38:16,839
and developed a pollen rash.

637
00:38:17,360 --> 00:38:18,559
It's nothing serious.

638
00:38:18,920 --> 00:38:20,080
As it happens,

639
00:38:20,320 --> 00:38:22,559
I've just prepared medicine
for pollen rashes.

640
00:38:26,480 --> 00:38:27,559
Here.

641
00:38:27,840 --> 00:38:30,039
Take one in the morning
and one at night with water.

642
00:38:30,360 --> 00:38:31,304
All right.

643
00:38:31,528 --> 00:38:33,208
Thank you for your trouble,
Physician Li.

644
00:38:33,210 --> 00:38:34,038
Not at all.

645
00:38:34,039 --> 00:38:35,319
Thank you, Grandpa Li.

646
00:38:35,320 --> 00:38:36,959
It's my duty.

647
00:38:37,480 --> 00:38:38,879
See Physician Li out.

648
00:38:44,199 --> 00:38:45,399
Physician Li,

649
00:38:45,760 --> 00:38:46,999
this way.

650
00:38:50,079 --> 00:38:50,999
I...

651
00:38:51,720 --> 00:38:52,568
You...

652
00:38:52,584 --> 00:38:54,150
Are you trying to get yourself killed?

653
00:38:54,159 --> 00:38:56,479
What are you doing
in the young ladies' courtyard?

654
00:38:57,119 --> 00:38:58,800
Young Master sent me.

655
00:38:59,432 --> 00:39:01,640
He told me to escort
Physician Li out of the residence.

656
00:39:04,616 --> 00:39:05,864
Madam, no need to see me.

657
00:39:05,880 --> 00:39:07,720
Jiugao can escort me just as well.

658
00:39:09,920 --> 00:39:10,598
Then...

659
00:39:10,599 --> 00:39:12,600
Take care, Physician Li.

660
00:39:13,800 --> 00:39:14,839
Please.

661
00:39:17,992 --> 00:39:20,296
She's feeling a little unwell.
Please take a look at her.

662
00:39:20,312 --> 00:39:21,830
Why is he being so secretive?

663
00:39:21,840 --> 00:39:23,519
I knew it couldn't be anything good.

664
00:39:58,480 --> 00:40:01,479
Did your skin suddenly
turn bright red in patches,

665
00:40:01,480 --> 00:40:02,720
as if painted with cinnabar?

666
00:40:04,719 --> 00:40:06,080
Yes.

667
00:40:06,480 --> 00:40:09,120
Then soon after, did you
develop a headache and fever?

668
00:40:10,719 --> 00:40:13,640
Yes, and I feel weak.

669
00:40:14,000 --> 00:40:17,080
A fever naturally makes you feel weak.

670
00:40:18,239 --> 00:40:19,439
This is erysipelas,

671
00:40:19,880 --> 00:40:21,839
caused by pathogenic wind and heat.

672
00:40:22,920 --> 00:40:23,879
In severe cases,

673
00:40:23,880 --> 00:40:25,176
it can develop into an abscess.

674
00:40:25,896 --> 00:40:27,550
Not only will the pain
become unbearable,

675
00:40:27,559 --> 00:40:28,919
but the skin may also ulcerate

676
00:40:28,920 --> 00:40:30,240
or even become necrotic.

677
00:40:30,679 --> 00:40:32,720
Fortunately,
you sought treatment in time.

678
00:40:39,800 --> 00:40:42,518
Keep her diet light
for the next few days.

679
00:40:42,519 --> 00:40:43,959
Keep her clean,

680
00:40:44,328 --> 00:40:46,120
and make sure she gets plenty of rest.

681
00:40:47,032 --> 00:40:49,290
She must avoid foods that
could aggravate the condition.

682
00:40:49,940 --> 00:40:52,180
(Astragalus, Coptis,
Phellodendron, Licorice, Forsythia)

683
00:40:52,440 --> 00:40:53,800
Send someone to get these herbs.

684
00:40:53,864 --> 00:40:55,310
Boil two bowls of water down to one.

685
00:40:55,320 --> 00:40:56,760
Take it twice a day.

686
00:40:56,800 --> 00:40:57,959
I'll get the medicine.

687
00:41:03,679 --> 00:41:04,439
All right.

688
00:41:06,079 --> 00:41:07,200
Go.

689
00:41:11,480 --> 00:41:12,638
Thank you, Physician.

690
00:41:12,639 --> 00:41:13,519
You're welcome.

691
00:41:18,320 --> 00:41:19,558
Good thing we listened to you

692
00:41:19,559 --> 00:41:21,399
and brought in a physician in time.

693
00:41:22,719 --> 00:41:25,118
Even with all my ideas,
I couldn't have managed this alone.

694
00:41:25,119 --> 00:41:28,439
Thankfully, Jiugao took care
of everything for us.

695
00:41:29,559 --> 00:41:30,479
Yes.

696
00:41:30,480 --> 00:41:32,479
Thank goodness for Jiugao.

697
00:41:34,760 --> 00:41:36,240
You two,

698
00:41:36,360 --> 00:41:38,080
that's enough.

699
00:41:46,020 --> 00:41:50,100
(Enduring the Cold)

700
00:41:55,260 --> 00:41:58,780
(Tongcao, Lin Xiuru's second-class maid)

701
00:41:59,400 --> 00:42:01,319
Now that Fourth Young Lady is ill,

702
00:42:01,320 --> 00:42:03,160
Young Lady must be lonely.

703
00:42:04,559 --> 00:42:06,359
Second Young Lady is really something.

704
00:42:06,360 --> 00:42:08,328
Instead of spending time
with her own sisters,

705
00:42:08,344 --> 00:42:10,030
she spends all day with

706
00:42:10,039 --> 00:42:11,399
that Young Lady Du.

707
00:43:04,820 --> 00:43:07,740
=Against the Current=
(Next Episode's Preview)

708
00:43:11,400 --> 00:43:12,839
Are you going out, Young Master?

709
00:43:12,840 --> 00:43:14,280
The night curfew has already begun.

710
00:43:15,199 --> 00:43:16,399
Tonight,

711
00:43:16,639 --> 00:43:18,359
I never left Zhichun Hall.

712
00:43:22,840 --> 00:43:24,439
Young Master was tired,

713
00:43:24,440 --> 00:43:26,718
so I helped Young Master
take a hot bath.

714
00:43:26,719 --> 00:43:27,518
After his bath,

715
00:43:27,519 --> 00:43:30,479
Young Master fell asleep and
slept straight through until morning.

716
00:43:34,840 --> 00:43:36,559
You're too clever

717
00:43:38,360 --> 00:43:41,400
to be a maid.

718
00:43:56,741 --> 00:44:00,861
♪Spring slips from the
branches once more♪

719
00:44:03,701 --> 00:44:08,221
♪Flowers bloom unseen,
as they have before♪

720
00:44:09,501 --> 00:44:13,421
♪All the joys and sorrows come and go♪

721
00:44:14,101 --> 00:44:16,861
♪While loss leaves winter in the heart♪

722
00:44:17,581 --> 00:44:19,901
♪Though all the world may fade♪

723
00:44:19,901 --> 00:44:22,981
♪Time rolls on as
countless lives rush by♪

724
00:44:24,501 --> 00:44:28,741
♪Night winds wander
through the halls of long ago♪

725
00:44:31,661 --> 00:44:35,821
♪No page could hold the
longing words can never show♪

726
00:44:37,621 --> 00:44:41,181
♪Every joy and sorrow
in this fleeting life♪

727
00:44:41,181 --> 00:44:44,741
♪Fades into the past
as new wounds rise♪

728
00:44:45,541 --> 00:44:51,221
♪While whispers of perfume
linger beneath the eaves♪

729
00:44:51,581 --> 00:44:55,901
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

730
00:44:56,261 --> 00:44:59,221
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

731
00:44:59,221 --> 00:45:02,981
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

732
00:45:02,981 --> 00:45:05,861
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

733
00:45:05,861 --> 00:45:09,941
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

734
00:45:09,941 --> 00:45:13,301
♪And silver moonlight to
guide me through the night♪

735
00:45:13,301 --> 00:45:17,061
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

736
00:45:17,061 --> 00:45:21,061
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪

737
00:45:21,821 --> 00:45:25,981
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

738
00:45:25,981 --> 00:45:29,421
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

739
00:45:29,421 --> 00:45:33,061
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

740
00:45:33,061 --> 00:45:35,941
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

741
00:45:35,941 --> 00:45:40,021
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

742
00:45:40,021 --> 00:45:43,381
♪And silver moonlight to
guide me through the night♪

743
00:45:43,381 --> 00:45:47,021
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

744
00:45:47,021 --> 00:45:54,821
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪
